_btn\" href=\"https://philhassey.itch.io/gbots/purchase\">Buy Now</a><span class=\"buy_message\"><span itemprop=\"price\" class=\"dollars\">$14.99 USD</span> <span class=\"sub\">or more</span></span></div></div></div><div class=\"columns\"><div class=\"left_col column\"><div class=\"formatted_description user_formatted\"><p>Galcon BOTS is an A.I. coding game.&nbsp; Watch your bots battle it out LIVE!<br></p>\r\n<p><button itchio aria-label=\"Click to activate Twitch video embed\" type=\"button\" class=\"embed_preload twitch_preload\" data-embed_code=\"&lt;iframe src=&quot;https://player.twitch.tv/?channel=galconbots&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;true&quot; scrolling=&quot;no&quot; height=&quot;378&quot; width=&quot;620&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;\" style=\"height: 378px; width: 620px\"></button><br></p>\r\n<p>Do you like coding?</p>\r\n<p>Are you interested in A.I.?<br></p>\r\n<p>Do you have a favorite text editor?</p>\r\n<p><img src=\"https://img.itch.zone/aW1nLzIwMTMxOTcucG5n/original/2BVE8w.png\" loading=\"lazy\"><br></p>\r\n<p>Do you enjoy modifying configuration files?<br></p>\r\n<p>Would you rather multi-bot than play?<br></p>\r\n<p>Does launching multiple simultaneous processes sound too good to be true?<br></p>\r\n<p>Do you love endless stats and replay data?<br></p>\r\n<p>Does this screenshot make you feel powerful?<br></p>\r\n<p><img src=\"https://img.itch.zone/aW1nLzIwMTMxNTgucG5n/original/cCX6LD.png\" loading=\"lazy\"></p>\r\n<p>Are you fluent in Python, Go, or Lua (or even some other language and are willing to port about 150 lines of protocol parsing code from any of the former)?</p>\r\n<p>Then Galcon BOTS is for YOU!&nbsp; Go get it NOW!&nbsp; Each download includes 5 keys: 1 for you, and 4 for your bots.</p>\r\n<p>If you aren&#x27;t sure what you are getting into, please read the tutorial first.</p>\r\n<p><a href=\"https://www.galcon.com/bots/tutorial.php\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" referrerpolicy=\"origin\">https://www.galcon.com/bots/tutorial.php</a><br></p></div><div class=\"more_information_toggle\"><div class=\"toggle_row\"><a class=\"toggle_info_btn\" href=\"javascript:void(0)\">More information<svg width=\"12\" height=\"6\" class=\"svgicon icon_down_tick\" role=\"img\" version=\"1.1\" aria-hidden viewBox=\"0 0 37 20\"><path d=\"m2.0858 0c-1.1535 0-2.0858 0.86469-2.0858 1.9331 0 0.5139 0.21354 1.0183 0.38704 1.1881l18.113 16.879 18.112-16.879c0.174-0.1696 0.388-0.674 0.388-1.1879 0-1.0684-0.932-1.9331-2.086-1.9331-0.577 0-1.111 0.23008-1.49 0.57992l-14.924 13.894-14.925-13.893c-0.3777-0.34998-0.9134-0.581-1.4902-0.581z\"/></svg></a></div><div class=\"info_panel_wrapper\"><div id=\"game_info_panel_5318325\" class=\"game_info_panel_widget base_widget\"><table><tbody><tr><td>Status</td><td><a href=\"https://itch.io/games/released\">Released</a></td></tr><tr><td>Platforms</td><td><a href=\"https://itch.io/games/platform-windows\">Windows</a>, <a href=\"https://itch.io/games/platform-osx\">macOS</a>, <a href=\"https://itch.io/games/platform-linux\">Linux</a></td></tr><tr><td>Rating</td><td><div itemscope itemtype=\"http://schema.org/AggregateRating\" class=\"aggregate_rating\" data-tooltip=\"5.00 average rating from 2 total ratings\" tabindex=\"0\" itemprop=\"aggregateRating\"><div itemprop=\"ratingValue\" class=\"star_value\" content=\"5.0\"><span class=\"screenreader_only\">Rated 5.0 out of 5 stars</span><div class=\"star_fill\" style=\"width: 100.00000%\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"star icon-star\"></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"star icon-star\"></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"star icon-star\"></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"star icon-star\"></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"star icon-star\"></span></div><div class=\"star_holes\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"star icon-star2\"></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"star icon-star2\"></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"star icon-star2\"></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\